{"id": "directional-complement-02-056", "zh": "她买完东西就回家去了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-057", "zh": "孩子们都跑进商店来了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-058", "zh": "比赛结束后球迷们都走出体育馆去了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-059", "zh": "她从包里拿出一张优惠券来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-060", "zh": "请你带一个球来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-061", "zh": "我把新球拍带回家去了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-062", "zh": "请你把这些衣服搬进来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-063", "zh": "老板没把那箱运动饮料从仓库里搬出来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-064", "zh": "我帮你把这箱水果搬上楼去"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-065", "zh": "这双球鞋看起来很新"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-066", "zh": "外面突然下起雨来了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-067", "zh": "请你把这个价格写下来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-068", "zh": "比赛开始前球场慢慢安静下来了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-069", "zh": "他一听就听出来是教练的声音"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-070", "zh": "老板把店门关上了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-071", "zh": "妈妈把那件外套拿回来了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-072", "zh": "售货员把那双球鞋拿出来给我看了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-073", "zh": "我没把钱包带回来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-074", "zh": "她没把新球拍拿上楼去"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-075", "zh": "外面下起雨来了"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-076", "zh": "那家店的东西看起来很贵"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-077", "zh": "请你把这个号码写下来"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-078", "zh": "再这样买下去钱会不够"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-079", "zh": "我看出来这个包是假的"}
{"id": "directional-complement-02-080", "zh": "他把外套穿上了"}
